AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000015 "In the Elevated Plus Maze task, this represents the percentage of the total test duration that the animal spends in any of the designated open arm zones (e.g., 'Open Arm (North)' and 'Open Arm (South)'). Unit: %")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000015 "elevated plus maze: open arm total - percent time during test duration"@en)
