AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000016 "In the Elevated Plus Maze task, this measures the time elapsed from the start of the test until the animal makes its first full body entry into the user-defined 'Open Arm (North)' zone. Unit: seconds")
