AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000018 "In the Elevated Plus Maze task, this measures the time elapsed from the start of the test until the animal makes its first full body entry into any of the designated open arm zones (e.g., 'Open Arm (North)' or 'Open Arm (South)'). Longer latencies often suggest higher anxiety. Unit: seconds")
