AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000129 "A video recording capturing the behavior of C. elegans during an experimental assay.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000129 "C. elegans behavioral assay: video recording"@en)
