# Class: obo:EMPTY_0000130 (obsolete C. elegans behavioral assay: arena mask)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000130 "A binary image (logical matrix) where pixels within the experimental arena for C. elegans are marked (true) and pixels outside are unmarked (false). This mask defines the region of interest for worm tracking and behavioral analysis.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000130 "obsolete C. elegans behavioral assay: arena mask"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000130 "Obsolete 2026-10-20 (tenet T19): a mask is NCIT:C201530 Binary Mask with the condition Imaging Region of Interest (NCIT:C85402) = arena (EMPTY:0000326). Kept for the v1 Haley et al. (2025) dataset, which may cite it.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:EMPTY_0000130 "NCIT:C201530")
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated obo:EMPTY_0000130 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

