AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000135 "A distinct anatomical region of the C. elegans worm, such as the head, midpoint, or tail, which can be tracked to quantify behavior.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000135 "obsolete C. elegans body part"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000135 "Obsolete 2026-10-20 (tenet T19): the general term NCIT:C32221 Body Part means the same; the species is the subject's. Kept for the v1 Haley et al. (2025) dataset, which may cite it.")
