AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000136 "obsolete C. elegans head"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000136 "Obsolete 2026-10-20 (tenet T19): the general term UBERON:0000033 head means the same; the species is the subject's. Kept for the v1 Haley et al. (2025) dataset, which may cite it.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:EMPTY_0000136 "UBERON:0000033")
