AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000138 "Obsolete 2026-10-20 (tenet T19): the general term UBERON:0002415 tail means the same; the species is the subject's. Kept for the v1 Haley et al. (2025) dataset, which may cite it.")
