# Class: obo:EMPTY_0000155 (bacterial patch border peak fluorescence intensity)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:EMPTY_0000155 "The maximum pixel intensity detected along the radial profile of a fluorescent bacterial patch, typically found at the patch edge where bacteria are actively proliferating. [Source: https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.103191.3]")
