AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000156 "Obsolete: a summary of a general quantity is stated as that quantity, with its statistic as the method and what it is about as conditions (T16 of the NDI V_eta tenets). Use fluorescence intensity (NCIT:C184706) with the condition location = bacterial patch edge (EMPTY:0000283). Kept for the v1 Haley et al. (2025) dataset, which may cite it.")
