AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000159 "obsolete bacterial patch center fluorescence amplitude"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000159 "Obsolete: a summary of a general quantity is stated as that quantity, with its statistic as the method and what it is about as conditions (T16 of the NDI V_eta tenets). Use fluorescence intensity (NCIT:C184706) with the method mean (STATO:0000573) and the condition region = bacterial patch center (EMPTY:0000284). Kept for the v1 Haley et al. (2025) dataset, which may cite it.")
