AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:EMPTY_0000373 "A hardware channel type of acquisition_channels.channels.type; the exact synonym 'do' is the standard data-acquisition abbreviation, and also the NDI v1 channel prefix (the migrator maps prefix to term, NDI maps term to prefix for its readers). Under NCIT Channel (C44170), the root of the channel-type binding, whose other two values are NCIT Metadata (C52095, v1 md) and NCIT Text (C25704, v1 tx). The 8 derived read modes (dep den dimp dimn aep aen aimp aimn) get no terms. No ontology term found (OLS4, 2026-10-22, label and synonym search; queries analog input, analog input channel, analog output, digital input, digital output, auxiliary input, time channel, event channel, marker channel, trigger channel, event marker: 0 hits each). Source: Jess Haley, 2026-10-22, did-schema tenet audit [B2 channel types].")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:EMPTY_0000373 "digital output channel"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:EMPTY_0000373 "do"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:EMPTY_0000373 obo:NCIT_C44170)

